      "message": "Fix an integer overflow problem in fts3 that could lead to a buffer overwrite on platforms where size_t is 32-bits. Bug [bugs:/info/2026-06-03T04:28:51Z | 2026-06-03T04:28:51Z].",
      "author": "dan",
