          }
        ],
        "severity": "high",
        "bug_type": "IntegerOverflow",
        "confidence": 0.97,
        "suggestion": "Add an upper bound check on iCol before calling fts3auxGrowStatArray. The column number must not exceed the actual number of columns in the FTS3 table (pFts3->nColumn). The fix replaces `iCol>0x3fffffff` (an insufficient intermediate guard) with `iCol>(pFts3->nColumn+1)`, ensuring the multiplication in fts3auxGrowStatArray cannot overflow even on 32-bit platforms.",
        "suggestion_code": "iCol = (int)v;\nif( iCol<1 || iCol>(pFts3->nColumn+1) ){\n  rc = SQLITE_CORRUPT_VTAB;\n  break;\n}",
